\item \textbf{Fixed by symmetry.} $w_K = +1$ (from Proca structure); $\rho_K \propto a^{-6}$ (from continuity with $w_K$); $N_{\text{DW}} = 1$ (from $S^1$ topology). \textbf{[D]}
